hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"263","Narrated by Salam bin Junada Al-Qurashi, narrated by Abu Muawiyah, on the authority of Abu Malik, and he is Saeed bin Tariq Al-Ashja’i, on the authority of Raba’i bin Harash, on the authority of Hudhayfah said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “This nation was preferred over all people in three things: The earth was made for us a place of mosque and purity. Our rows were made like the rows of angels, and I was given these verses from the end of Surah Al-Baqarah, from a treasure house under the Throne, of which no one has been given. Before me and no one after me.”"
